, §§ 703.550, 706.107\n\nNotice of Hearing on Claim of Exemption  \n(Wage Garnishment—Enforcement of Judgment)\n\nWG-010/EJ-175, Page 1 of 1\n\nFor your protection and privacy, please press the Clear button after you have printed the form.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n| California Courts | Self Help Guide (https://selfhelp.courts.ca.gov/find-forms?page=3&query=EA-)\nciteturn1981search6 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today;   * EJ-175 * Notice of Hearing on Claim of Exemption (Wage Garnishment—Enforcement of Judgment) Effective: July 1, 2026 汉语 한국어 español\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n| California Courts | Self Help Guide (https://selfhelp.courts.ca.gov/find-forms?page=0&query=RC-)\nciteturn1981search7 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today;   * EJ-175 * Notice of Hearing on Claim of Exemption (Wage Garnishment—Enforcement of Judgment) Effective: July 1, 2026 汉语 한국어 español\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n| California Courts | Self Help Guide (https://selfhelp.courts.ca.gov/find-forms?page=0&query=UD-)\nciteturn1981search8 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 days ago;   * EJ-175 * Notice of Hearing on Claim of Exemption (Wage Garnishment—Enforcement of Judgment) Effective: July 1, 2026 汉语 한국어 español ...   * WG-010 * Notice of Hearing on Claim of Exemption (Wage Garnishment—Enforcement of Judgment) Effective: July 1, 2026 汉语 한국어 español\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n| California Courts | Self Help Guide (https://selfhelp.courts.ca.gov/find-forms?page=0&query=JUD-)\nciteturn1981search9 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today;   * EJ-175 * Notice of Hearing on Claim of Exemption (Wage Garnishment—Enforcement of Judgment) Effective: July 1, 2026 汉语 한국어 español ...   * WG-010 * Notice of Hearing on Claim of Exemption (Wage Garnishment—Enforcement of Judgment) Effective: July 1, 2026 汉语 한국